1
00:01:02,140 --> 00:01:05,980
=The Cruel Tribunal=
=Episode 21=

2
00:01:16,220 --> 00:01:19,680
(Tomb of Beloved Wife Rousang)

3
00:01:19,710 --> 00:01:23,940
♪Lamp flames shatter under the eaves♪

4
00:01:26,040 --> 00:01:30,870
♪Wind rises as old friends stay near♪

5
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:35,760
First bow.

6
00:01:36,920 --> 00:01:38,480
A match made in heaven.

7
00:01:44,440 --> 00:01:47,510
♪Wind blows at the moment of parting♪

8
00:01:47,710 --> 00:01:50,830
♪Sleeves brush past the dust♪

9
00:01:50,990 --> 00:01:53,700
♪The road here was full of old friends♪

10
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:57,140
♪Only your shadow remains where you go♪

11
00:01:57,280 --> 00:01:58,320
Second bow.

12
00:02:02,760 --> 00:02:04,720
A union blessed by earth.

13
00:02:32,000 --> 00:02:33,280
Third bow.

14
00:02:37,880 --> 00:02:38,960
Husband and wife

15
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:42,180
♪Blown away by frost and snow♪

16
00:02:43,200 --> 00:02:44,520
growing old together.

17
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:48,370
♪Turning around feels like goodbye♪

18
00:02:48,560 --> 00:02:51,590
♪Wind blows at the moment of parting♪

19
00:02:51,590 --> 00:02:54,890
♪Vows scatter into a sky of stars♪

20
00:02:54,900 --> 00:02:57,740
♪Destiny turns into a single page♪

21
00:02:57,740 --> 00:03:01,250
♪Tear stains blur your name♪

22
00:03:01,350 --> 00:03:05,650
♪If there is a next life,
I will still seek you♪

23
00:03:08,060 --> 00:03:14,300
♪Willing to use a lifetime♪

24
00:03:18,380 --> 00:03:21,900
(Tomb of Beloved Wife Rousang)

25
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:34,000
(I swear)

26
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:37,320
(everything you took from me)

27
00:03:39,240 --> 00:03:40,800
(must be returned.)

28
00:04:10,600 --> 00:04:12,000
I asked you to come

29
00:04:12,880 --> 00:04:15,480
because I wanted to apologize
for my reckless behavior

30
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,680
at my brother's wedding.

31
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:32,000
Your Highness.

32
00:04:34,440 --> 00:04:35,400
I

33
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:37,720
specially prepared

34
00:04:38,900 --> 00:04:40,120
your favorite

35
00:04:41,400 --> 00:04:43,040
snow dew pastry.

36
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,880
By the way,

37
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:01,000
there is an old acquaintance of yours

38
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,360
who really wants to see you.

39
00:05:04,880 --> 00:05:05,760
Come in.

40
00:05:15,760 --> 00:05:17,880
Your sisterhood from
before entering the palace

41
00:05:20,200 --> 00:05:22,240
is really touching.

42
00:05:26,840 --> 00:05:27,640
Speak.

43
00:05:28,960 --> 00:05:30,000
What do you want?

44
00:05:39,960 --> 00:05:41,440
I hope

45
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,440
to inherit the throne.

46
00:05:47,440 --> 00:05:49,040
If you agree,

47
00:05:50,840 --> 00:05:51,680
this person

48
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:55,240
will be yours to handle.

49
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,520
I can help you ascend the throne,

50
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,760
but ancestral rules are strict.

51
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:28,560
Pass to the eldest son, not the younger.

52
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:31,080
This is heavenly fate.

53
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:34,040
Your biggest obstacle

54
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,640
is not me,

55
00:06:37,640 --> 00:06:39,120
but your brother.

56
00:06:41,640 --> 00:06:42,640
Since that is so,

57
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:44,840
then please

58
00:06:46,000 --> 00:06:47,520
let Sizhou leave the palace.

59
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:49,840
I have my own plans.

60
00:06:51,480 --> 00:06:53,080
Rest assured, Mother.

61
00:06:54,320 --> 00:06:56,080
After I ascend the throne,

62
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:58,680
I will still respect you,

63
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,920
keep your secret,

64
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,040
and show filial piety.

65
00:07:11,760 --> 00:07:13,840
As for all these past events,

66
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:20,320
just dust them off,

67
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,120
and they will be clean.

68
00:07:35,080 --> 00:07:36,960
Since you have already
made up your mind,

69
00:07:37,240 --> 00:07:38,440
why come and ask me?

70
00:07:38,960 --> 00:07:40,040
Am I wrong?

71
00:07:41,640 --> 00:07:43,840
Only with choices
can there be right or wrong.

72
00:07:44,240 --> 00:07:46,840
This world has never given you a choice.

73
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:48,360
Where does right or wrong come from?

74
00:07:48,680 --> 00:07:50,080
What if there were a choice?

75
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,480
What if there were a different outcome?

76
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:55,080
Whether you choose or not,

77
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:56,560
no matter what the outcome is,

78
00:07:56,720 --> 00:07:57,720
you just need to remember

79
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:58,640
that in this world,

80
00:07:58,880 --> 00:08:00,440
no one cares about you more than I do,

81
00:08:00,680 --> 00:08:02,160
and no one loves you more than I do.

82
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,440
Then will you regret it?

83
00:08:04,680 --> 00:08:05,080
Yes,

84
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:06,440
you will.

85
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:08,280
You will lose sleep all night,

86
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,480
suffering in memories again and again,

87
00:08:10,480 --> 00:08:11,840
waking up from nightmares.

88
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,280
But because of this,

89
00:08:13,480 --> 00:08:15,560
you will know clearer than anyone else

90
00:08:15,560 --> 00:08:16,880
why you are alive.

91
00:08:16,880 --> 00:08:18,680
You must keep pushing yourself.

92
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:21,440
You treasure this position
more than anyone

93
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,480
because only you know best

94
00:08:23,680 --> 00:08:24,920
what price you paid

95
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:26,840
to get here today.

96
00:08:28,240 --> 00:08:29,880
Even if I fall into eternal damnation?

97
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:32,520
You will be the most suitable queen.

98
00:08:34,320 --> 00:08:36,120
Even if I am deeply lonely?

99
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:40,280
You do not need
to explain anything to others,

100
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:43,440
nor do you need others to understand.

101
00:08:44,480 --> 00:08:45,840
The people and the world

102
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:47,720
are your responsibility.

103
00:08:51,880 --> 00:08:52,840
Yes,

104
00:08:54,560 --> 00:08:56,440
I will go forward without looking back.

105
00:09:03,280 --> 00:09:04,280
Mr. He Dang.

106
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:06,760
Miss Xiaobai.

107
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:07,760
I am leaving.

108
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:09,480
From now on, this place

109
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,160
will be left to you.

110
00:09:11,680 --> 00:09:13,160
I will take good care of it

111
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,680
until you return.

112
00:09:20,860 --> 00:09:27,980
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

113
00:09:31,860 --> 00:09:38,100
(Guaranteed Win Legal House)

114
00:09:55,880 --> 00:09:56,680
Zhou,

115
00:09:57,480 --> 00:09:58,400
go.

116
00:10:00,080 --> 00:10:01,480
Starting today,

117
00:10:02,560 --> 00:10:03,520
you are free.

118
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:20,080
(My son,)

119
00:10:20,920 --> 00:10:22,120
(I had no choice.)

120
00:10:23,480 --> 00:10:24,280
(I will repay)

121
00:10:25,280 --> 00:10:26,840
(what I owe you in the next life.)

122
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,560
Your Highness,

123
00:10:37,680 --> 00:10:39,600
Her Highness ordered me to tell you

124
00:10:39,600 --> 00:10:41,160
that the First Prince
has left the palace.

125
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,280
I understand.

126
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:04,160
(This path is too narrow,)

127
00:11:05,080 --> 00:11:07,720
(too narrow for two
to walk side by side.)

128
00:11:09,160 --> 00:11:10,760
(I can only use your blood)

129
00:11:11,800 --> 00:11:14,880
(to pave my path to ultimate power.)

130
00:11:37,700 --> 00:11:39,420
(Cen)

131
00:11:45,420 --> 00:11:47,900
(Cen)

132
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,800
Songpiao is Lu Cen,

133
00:11:55,800 --> 00:11:57,400
and Lu Cen is Songpiao.

134
00:11:58,960 --> 00:12:00,000
Pass down the order.

135
00:12:00,800 --> 00:12:02,520
Cast a dragnet.

136
00:12:02,560 --> 00:12:04,200
We must capture the traitor Songpiao.

137
00:12:09,930 --> 00:12:12,530
♪The candle burns down
to its final glow♪

138
00:12:13,490 --> 00:12:15,890
♪Cold fragrance clings to my hem♪

139
00:12:16,530 --> 00:12:18,290
♪You gently smooth my hair♪

140
00:12:18,290 --> 00:12:21,210
♪Yet your gaze drifts far away♪

141
00:12:23,650 --> 00:12:26,090
♪A hidden blade lies beneath your smile♪

142
00:12:26,450 --> 00:12:29,770
♪You turn away
as if nothing has changed♪

143
00:12:30,370 --> 00:12:31,930
♪Step by step, I walk away♪

144
00:12:32,090 --> 00:12:35,410
♪Each step breaks my heart anew♪

145
00:12:38,170 --> 00:12:41,050
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

146
00:12:41,570 --> 00:12:44,650
♪Why leave me
standing alone in the wind?♪

147
00:12:45,090 --> 00:12:47,690
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

148
00:12:47,690 --> 00:12:51,730
♪Yet all that's left
is warmth upon my fingertips♪

149
00:12:51,970 --> 00:12:55,010
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

150
00:12:55,410 --> 00:12:58,090
♪And write of every meeting
and every parting♪

151
00:12:58,090 --> 00:13:00,810
♪If next life asks
about the days gone by♪

152
00:13:01,090 --> 00:13:04,050
♪I'll only say that once♪

153
00:13:04,530 --> 00:13:06,290
♪I called your name♪

154
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:13,130
♪The silent stars hang low♪

155
00:13:14,530 --> 00:13:16,730
♪The river keeps flowing east♪

156
00:13:17,970 --> 00:13:19,890
♪I linger in the old tower♪

157
00:13:20,010 --> 00:13:23,650
♪Waiting for you,
though all is now empty♪

158
00:13:24,970 --> 00:13:27,410
♪This life still owes us a bow♪

159
00:13:28,290 --> 00:13:31,090
♪May the next repay us with a dream♪

160
00:13:31,850 --> 00:13:34,090
♪Beyond here lie
endless mountains and rivers♪

161
00:13:34,090 --> 00:13:40,330
♪I dare not turn for one last look♪

162
00:13:40,610 --> 00:13:43,490
♪If fate had not gone astray♪

163
00:13:44,090 --> 00:13:47,570
♪Why bury this heart beneath the frost?♪

164
00:13:47,570 --> 00:13:50,210
♪We shared one fleeting life together♪

165
00:13:50,210 --> 00:13:54,490
♪Now only fading warmth
remains in my palm♪

166
00:13:54,490 --> 00:13:57,410
♪I'd melt this night into ink♪

167
00:13:57,850 --> 00:14:00,570
♪And paint a winter between your brows♪

168
00:14:00,570 --> 00:14:03,250
♪If we meet again in another life♪

169
00:14:03,570 --> 00:14:06,290
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

170
00:14:06,970 --> 00:14:09,250
♪Was when we first met?♪

171
00:14:10,530 --> 00:14:12,930
♪Will you believe that tonight♪

172
00:14:14,050 --> 00:14:15,810
♪Was when we met for the last time?♪
